  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PILOT FUEL SWITCH PROJECT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">On a pilot basis, this activity will assist Bulgaria in defining the actual costs and benefits of switching fuel from fossil fuels to wood in medium-sized municipal building heating systems.  As part of the parent Forest Development Project, the carbon fund component will calculate the potential carbon credits and development of a monitoring plan for quantifying the carbon credits. This scheme will not only provide a cheaper sources of heating fuel for municipalities but will also provide the communities with additional long-term income through the Carbon Fund.  Results of this activity will be disseminated through public awareness measures to inform a wide public and encourage replication throughout the country.  It is expected that the benefits will quickly recuperate the initial costs of such a switch and will cause a high demand for switching elsewhere in the country. Amounts of Emissions Purchases TBD during preparation.</narrative>
  </description>
